# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify static header file. Same values as netlify.toml,
# kept so a drag-and-drop deploy of apps/demo/dist also gets the right headers.
#
# COEP is deliberately absent — require-corp blocks the model-weight fetch and
# silently disables the on-device tier in production. See docs/DEPLOY.md.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
